# .dockerignore for the GhostDrive image build.
#
# CAVEAT (honest): the compose file builds with context ../.. (the repo root),
# and Docker loads ignore rules from the CONTEXT ROOT, not from next to the
# Dockerfile. For these rules to actually apply, either copy this file to the
# repo root as .dockerignore, or build with BuildKit and name it
# packaging/docker/Dockerfile.dockerignore (BuildKit honors that path next to
# the Dockerfile). As shipped, this file documents intent and is enforced only
# in the second arrangement.

.git
.gitignore
.github

tests
docs
dist
build
installer
scripts

# Other packaging artifacts are not needed inside the image build.
packaging

node_modules
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.venv
venv

.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.hypothesis
.nonces
.coverage

# Repo-root noise that must never enter the build context.
*.log
ghostdrive.log
Start GhostDrive.bat
GhostDrive_ProjectSpec_v1.2.txt
ghostdrive_integration.session
discord_test.py
